WEBVTT

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:05.656
Nina imani kua maandamano
ya haki za kirangi

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:10.536
zinalazimika kua za ukombozi na sio
uhalifu.

00:16:10.560 --> 00:16:13.416
Na ndio, ninaamini

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:17.640
kua tunatakiwa kutoa uwezekano
wa ukombozi kwa kila mtu.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.936
Na tunatakiwa kuwa tayari,

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:24.376
licha ya baadhi ya lugha kali

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:29.416
zinazotoka kwa hao hao watu
wanaotukandamiza,

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:33.976
nafikiri ni lazima tuwasikilize